# AFFINITY '26 frontend — environment variables
#
# The frontend needs NO environment variables for registration any more.
#
# Registration is submitted to the same-origin proxy  /affinity26/api/register  (Cloudflare Pages Function in the
# project root: functions/affinity26/api/register.js). The Google Apps Script URL lives ONLY in the server-side
# secret GOOGLE_APPS_SCRIPT_ENDPOINT — never in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable and never in this folder.
# See the root README.md ("Registration proxy") and the root .env.example.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REGISTRATION_ENDPOINT is obsolete and ignored; do not set it.
